  m_Name: Level 3 Questions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HokkienQuizQuestionBank
  questions:
  - question: "Why is \u62C5\u4ED4\u9762 also called \u5EA6\u5C0F\u6708\u62C5\u4ED4\u9762\uFF1F"
    choices:
    - It was created by a person named Xiao Yue
    - It was a celebration food that people ate during the small months
    - It was a dish that fisherman carried on poles to sell during the small months
    - It originated from a ferry crossing called Xiao Yue
    choiceExplanations:
    - This is made up.
    - This is made up.
    - "\u5EA6\u5C0F\u6708\u62C5\u4ED4\u9762 is noodles in a pork and shrimp head
      broth, with shrimp, chicken, egg, and bean sprouts on top. Also known as \u5EA6\u5C0F\u6708\u62C5\u4ED4\u9762,
      which directly translates to \u201Cget through the small month noodle on carrying
      pole\u201D.  Months with frequent typhoons are called \u201C\u5C0F\u6708\u201D(small
      month). During these times, it is hard to go out to sea, so fishermen carried
      noodles on carrying poles and sold noodles for a living during these months.
      The noodles on a carrying pole helps them get through the small month, giving
      it the \u5EA6\u5C0F\u6708\u62C5\u4ED4\u9762 its name."
    - This is made up.
    correctAnswerIndex: 2
  - question: Which of the following means allergy?
    choices:
    - "\u8FC7\u654F"
    - "\u6599\u7406"
    - "\u725B\u8089"
    - "\u4E0D\u8981"
    choiceExplanations:
    - This means allergy in Hokkien.
    - This means "cook" in Hokkien.
    - This means "beef" in Hokkien.
    - This means "I don't want..." in Hokkien.
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
  - question: "What is \u8089\u5706?"
    choices:
    - A Taiwanese dumpling made of starch and rice flour, filled with meat and vegetables
    - A dish that fisherman carried on poles to sell during the small months
    - A Taiwanese meat ball that is served in a meat and vegetable broth
    - A Taiwanese dumpling made from wheat flour, filled with meat and vegetables
    choiceExplanations:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
